<<8>> Give me a sentence construction exercise for a student learning Spanish. It should have a subsection for answers. It should be an exercise on re-ordering sentences. <<Prompt>>
<<8>> Re-order the following sentences to create a correct sentence.
\begin{enumerate}
    \item (Ella) (ser) actriz. (She is an actress.)
    \item (Ellos) (comer) (tostada) y (tomar) (café). (They eat toast and drink coffee.)
    \item (Él) (vender) (su) (coche) el próximo mes. (He sells his car next month.)
    \item (Yo) (comprar) (un) (vestido) el próximo mes. (I buy a dress next month.)
    \item (Nosotros) (bajar) (el) (río) en (barca). (We go down the river by boat.)
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Ella es actriz.
\item Ellos comen tostada y toman café.
\item Él venderá su coche el próximo mes.
\item Yo compraré un vestido el próximo mes.
\item Nosotros bajamos el río en barca.
\end{enumerate} <<Generation>>
