<<31>> Give me a combination of a group activity and a research exercise for a 5th grade student learning social studies. It should be an exercise on safety. <<Prompt>>
<<31>> Work in a group to carry out some research about how to stay safe in your local environment. Present your findings. Think of ways in which you could make other people aware of the safety issues you have identified. Present these ideas. Suggest how the issues could be addressed. Present your suggestions. Carry out some of the ideas you have presented in Activity 3. Present what happened. Present what you think should be done to make the local environment a safer place to live in. Suggest who should be responsible for doing this. Present your suggestions. Describe how you will continue to be involved in this issue. Present your ideas. <<Generation>>
<<32>> Give me a translation exercise for a student learning French. It should have a subsection for answers. It should be an exercise on using vous and inversion. <<Prompt>>
<<32>> Traduire les phrases suivantes en utilisant vous et l'inversion si nécessaire.
\begin{enumerate}
    \item You should not miss this film.
    \item He should not forget to call us.
    \item We should not be late.
    \item I should not make this decision alone.
    \item You should not walk alone at night.
    \item He should not have told you that.
    \item I should not have accepted this job.
    \item She should not have gone to that restaurant.
    \item He should not have written this book.
    \item You should not have said that.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Vous ne devriez pas manquer ce film.
\item Il ne devrait pas oublier de nous appeler.
\item Nous ne devrions pas être en retard.
\item Je ne devrais pas prendre cette décision tout seul.
\item Vous ne devriez pas marcher seul la nuit.
\item Il n'aurait pas dû vous dire cela.
\item Je n'aurais pas dû accepter ce travail.
\item Elle n'aurait pas dû aller dans ce restaurant.
\item Il n'aurait pas dû écrire ce livre.
\item Vous n'auriez pas dû dire cela.
\end{enumerate} <<Generation>>
