n various professions. In conclusion, your task is to provide a comprehensive description of cubes and cuboids, covering their geometric properties, differences, similarities, and practical applications. Use diagrams and examples to support your explanations and ensure your description is clear and easy to understand. The goal is to help someone understand these shapes and their significance in both theoretical and practical contexts. <<Generation>>
