<<747>> Give me a multiple choice exercise for a student learning Spanish. It should have a subsection for answers. It should be an exercise on possessive pronouns. <<Prompt>>
<<747>> \begin{enumerate}
    \item “These are \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_.” (These are mine.)
    \begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
        \item Mías
        \item Mías son
    \end{enumerate}

    \item “This is \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_.” (This is ours.)
    \begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
        \item Nuestro
        \item Nuestro es
    \end{enumerate}

    \item “That is \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_.” (That is theirs.)
    \begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
        \item Su
        \item Su es
    \end{enumerate}

    \item “Those are \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_.” (Those are his.)
    \begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
        \item Su
        \item Su son
    \end{enumerate}

    \item “This is \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_.” (This is yours.)
    \begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
        \item Tu
        \item Tu es
    \end{enumerate}
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Mías
\item Nuestro
\item Su
\item Su
\item Tu
\end{enumerate} <<Generation>>
